      "GroupDto": {
        "GroupName": "ACC",
        "Description": "Four Logic Gate Bit cells as the 4-bit accumulator register, signal names at the IsaAccumulatorSignalMap defaults (ACC.D0–ACC.D3, ACC.LOAD → ACC.Q0–ACC.Q3), placed below the adder and the RAM so three machine units share one logic network (#1470).",
